    "params": {
     "text": "Rules in **Conditional formatting**:\n\n    units top 3    => row green\n    units bottom 3 => row red\n    sku if units top 1 => icon ★ amber\n\n`top 10%` works too. They are measured over the whole column, and a tie\nwith the last place is included.",
